Cancelling DisplayDialog: Tools Rig Rebuilt (URP): SELECT + measure + walls + floor. Phase A (editing) added:
  • Left-hand PALETTE = tool type (Sel/Meas/Wall/Floor) + snap toggles (Cor/Edg/Grd/Ang/Scan).
  • SELECT tool (default): point at a wall/floor/measurement + trigger to select; hold trigger
    to drag it on the ground plane; B = delete; X = undo, Y = redo. Inspector shows the picked object.
  • Floating INSPECTOR holds Wall/Floor settings; grip its title bar to move it.
Floor tool: 2 corners → slab at Level (Thk). Plan image = plan.png in app folder.
Measure: trigger = points; '+' at any point = chain; point+trigger = drag; point+B = delete.
Walls: trigger = centerline points (chain), B = finish. Thickness grows outward.

Next: Ctrl+S → Ctrl+B.
This should not be called in batch mode.
